senses.gloss:
द्रढय द्रढय (fr. दृढ), Nom. P. द्र-
ढयति, -यितुम्, to make firm, fasten, tighten;
confirm, corroborate, affirm, assert; [cf. दृढय.]

द्रमिल द्रमिल, अस्, m., N. of a country;
of a lexicographer [cf. द्रिमिल]; (आस्), m. pl., N.
of a school.

द्राप द्राप, अस्, m. mud, mire; heaven, sky;
a fool, blockhead, an idiot; a N. of Śiva with his hair
twisted or matted; a small shell, Cypræa Moneta.
